<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/ECO_BB3/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:R27::ECO_BB3";
        dc:date                "2021-08-09 12:23:38.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:R27::ECO_BB3";
        pav:authoredOn         "2021-08-09 12:23:38.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/ECO_BB3/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "ECO_BB3";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R26/current/SBE/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R26/current/WETLABS/>;
        skos:definition        "A three optical-sensor instrument fitted with three scattering meters measuring at a user-defined combination of 470 nm, 532 nm, 650 nm and 700 nm wavelengths, depth-rated to 600 m. The scattering sensor has an in-water centroid angle of 124 deg. The instrument is part of the Environmental Characterization Optics (ECO) series tools, originally developed and manufactured at WET Labs and rebranded as a Sea-Bird Scientific product following the company's acquisition by Danaher in 2010."@en;
        skos:definition        "Un instrument à trois capteurs optiques équipé de trois diffusimètres mesurant selon une combinaison définie par l'utilisateur des longueurs d'onde 470 nm, 532 nm, 650 nm et 700 nm, classé pour 600 m. Le capteur de diffusion a un angle centroïde dans l'eau de 124 deg. L'instrument fait partie de la série d'outils Environmental Characterization Optics (ECO), développé à l'origine et fabriqué par WET Labs, puis rebaptisé produit Sea-Bird Scientific suite à l'acquisition de l'entreprise par Danaher en 2010."@fr ;
        skos:notation          "SDN:R27::ECO_BB3";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "ECO Triplet BB3 sensor package with three scattering meters"@en;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R25/current/BACKSCATTERINGMETER_BBP532/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R25/current/BACKSCATTERINGMETER_BBP700/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R25/current/BACKSCATTERINGMETER_BBP470/> .

