        skos:altLabel          "SBE63_OPTODE";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R26/current/SBE/>;
        skos:definition        "An optical dissolved oxygen sensor, manufactured by Sea-Bir Scientific and designed to be integrated into a pumped CTD system. Depth rating: 600 m (plastic housing) or 7000 m (titanium housing); oxygen concentration initial accuracy: 2 % saturation; response time (63 %): < 6 s; output signal: RS-232."@en;
        skos:definition        "Un capteur optique d'oxygène dissous, fabriqué par Sea-Bir Scientific et conçu pour être intégré à un système CTD pompé. Profondeur nominale : 600 m (boîtier plastique) ou 7000 m (boîtier titane) ; précision initiale de concentration en oxygène : 2 % de saturation ; temps de réponse (63 %) : < 6 s ; signal de sortie : RS-232."@fr ;
        skos:notation          "SDN:R27::SBE63_OPTODE";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Sea-Bird Scientific SBE 63 oxygen optode"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Optode à oxygène Sea-Bird Scientific SBE 63"@fr ;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R25/current/OPTODE_DOXY/> .

<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/SBE41CP_V1/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:R27::SBE41CP_V1";
        dc:date                "2025-04-03 11:54:29.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:R27::SBE41CP_V1";
        pav:authoredOn         "2025-04-03 11:54:29.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/SBE41CP_V1/3/>;
        pav:hasVersion         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/SBE41CP_V1/2/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/SBE41CP_V1/1/>;
        pav:version            "3";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "true";
        owl:versionInfo        "3";
        skos:altLabel          "SBE41CP_V1";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R26/current/SBE/>;
        skos:definition        "A system comprising temperature, conductivity and pressure sensors with pump-controlled, T-C ducted flow. This CTD operates in continuous profiling (CP) mode, thus sampling at 1 Hz during float ascent, logging the data in internal memory and transmitting to the float controller when the float reaches the surface. This SBE41CP model has firmware version 1."@en;
        skos:definition        "Système comprenant des capteurs de température, de conductivité et de pression à flux canalisé T-C contrôlé par pompe. Ce CTD fonctionne en mode de profilage continu (CP), échantillonnant à 1 Hz pendant la montée du flotteur, enregistrant les données en mémoire interne et les transmettant au contrôleur du flotteur lorsqu'il atteint la surface. Ce modèle SBE41CP a le firmware version 1.."@fr ;
        skos:notation          "SDN:R27::SBE41CP_V1";
        skos:note              "deprecated"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Sea-Bird Scientific SBE 41CP CTD V1"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "CTD Sea-Bird Scientific SBE 41CP V1"@fr ;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/SBE41CP/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R25/current/CTD_PRES/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R25/current/CTD_TEMP/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R25/current/CTD_CNDC/> .

<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/SBE41/>
